1
00:00:09,430 --> 00:00:11,720
Senpai...

2
00:00:14,720 --> 00:00:16,730
If I were a woman,

3
00:00:16,730 --> 00:00:18,350
I would love you so deeply,

4
00:00:18,350 --> 00:00:20,600
